(PUBLIC HEALTH ENGINEERING DEPARTMENT — Tender CE/ELE/33/2026-27) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCOPE OF WORK) Tj T*
(This specification covers supply and installation of borewell submersible pumpsets and water) Tj T*
(quality testing complete in all respects.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATION — BOREWELL SUBMERSIBLE PUMPSETS) Tj T*
(\(a\) SUBMERSIBLE PUMPSETS FOR BOREWELLS SHALL COMPLY WITH IS 8034:2018.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Duty point of each pumpset shall be 18 cu.m/hr at 90 metre total head.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The motors shall be wet type, water filled, complying with IS 9283:2013.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Flat submersible cables shall be copper conductor, PVC insulated, 3 core 6 Sq mm, complying) Tj T*
(with IS 694:2010 and tested to IS 10810.) Tj T*
(\(e\) An automatic starter with dry run protection and single phasing preventer shall be supplied) Tj T*
(with every pumpset.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 4: TREATED WATER QUALITY) Tj T*
(\(a\) The quality of treated water shall comply with IS 10500:2012.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The pH value of treated water shall lie within 6.5 to 8.5.) Tj T*
(\(c\) TDS of treated water shall be limited to 2000 mg per litre.) Tj T*
(\(d\) The turbidity of treated water shall be limited to 1 NTU..) Tj T*
(\(e\) Fluoride \(as F\) shall be limited to 1.5 mg per litre.) Tj T*
(\(f\) Nitrate \(as NO3\) shall be limited to 45 mg per litre.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Arsenic \(as As\) shall be limited to 0.01 mg per litre.) Tj T*
(\(h\) Total hardness \(as CaCO3\) shall be limited to 200 mg per litre. No E. coli shall be) Tj T*
(detected in any 100 ml sample.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SECTION 5: TESTING, INSPECTION AND CERTIFICATION) Tj T*
(\(a\) All pumpsets shall carry the BIS Standard Mark.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Testing of water samples shall be done at a NABL accredited laboratory as per IS 3025.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
(Page 2 of 3) Tj T*
ET
endstream
